h Robert Altman who hated naturalism  is in the sound because it was  informational about the content and you  can't have some negative feeling about  that you have to embrace that and fall  in love with that there are many great  films that had all post sync sound I've  come from Eastern Europe and Italy in  other places are they lesser films  because they were not you know done  organically or naturally no they're  there their lessons on staying involved  with the characters staying involved  with the storylines staying involved  with the storytelling and as long as you  can do that and and support your  characters existence inside the illusion  of the film the rest of what you do will  fall into place
 

